9
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:28,130
It’s simply more tiring than negotiating a business worth one hundred thousand taels.

10
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:30,210
The first time that prince came home

11
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:31,210
mediocre

12
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:32,410
Don't dislike it

13
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:33,610
Stop making copies

14
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:37,520
Yu'er, this child, has been spoiled by us since she was a child.

15
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,520
something wrong

16
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:41,400
